cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you reference this analysis, please cite it as below.
title: "Bun's Rust rewrite: bug reports, release delivery and download growth"
authors:
  - family-names: Smyshliaev
    given-names: Aleksandr
  - family-names: Gulya
    given-names: Ilya
version: "2026.10.30"
date-released: 2026-10-30
url: "https://github.com/IlyaGulya/bun-rust-rewrite-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Updated fork of Aleksandr Smyshliaev's observational study of Bun's May 2026
  Zig-to-Rust rewrite. Covers issue arrivals through October 30, 2026, with
  daily version/type stacks, npm download proxies through October 28,
  closure follow-up and separate crash/memory-retention report comparisons.
  Report-per-download indicators decline across the merge, but exposure,
  reporting behaviour and classification limits prevent attributing the change to Rust.
keywords:
  - rust
  - zig
  - bun
  - ai-assisted-development
  - empirical-software-engineering
